      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "The Zabrak offers a stony glower, her expression rather dour. She doesn't seem particularly fond of the thankless task of playing sentinel to the entrance of the Twilight Praxeum, and she all but radiates an air of vague irritation at being bothered. \"What?\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00010",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00008",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00004",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00001",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00000",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00001": {
      "Id": "entry-00001",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"First, understand that we don't tolerate weaklings or whiners, whether you wish to take the path of a Sith and learn how to master the Force, or whether you wish to don the uniform of a Revanite Guard and become one of the elite soldiers of the galaxy. Heed my warning well. Some of my peers may tend to frequent this watering hole, and you may speak to them. They may test you, whether in the arena or elsewhere. As an aspirant, you will be expected to be loyal and to be ever-striving towards perfection. More than that, well, you will learn and find out, I guess.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00003",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00002",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00002": {
      "Id": "entry-00002",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"Our Order? We are those who decided that Malak's madness is intolerable, and that his actions are a stain upon the legacy of Darth Revan. We rebel against his claim to throne of the Sith Empire, and the notion that he is the lord of us who seek the mantle of Sith. We are led by my Master, Lord Valerius, and we fight against him as we seek to put an end to Malak's insane reign. It's that simple, really.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00006",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00005",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00003": {
      "Id": "entry-00003",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"We... are, yes, though what it means to be Sith can be, hrmph. A matter of some debate. Some of the Lords hold differing opinions, but we are united by one common ground: Malak must end.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00007",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00004": {
      "Id": "entry-00004",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"You may call me Eav. I am one of Lord Valerius' apprentice, and I am here to make sure karkin' idiots don't go around causing trouble in this pet project of his. I don't care about titles, but I will be your living nightmare if you should give me more paperwork to do. I will take it on your fingers. You have been warned.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00009",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00005": {
      "Id": "entry-00005",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"The Twilight Praxeum. The heart of my Master's grand design, the new base of operation of the Revanite Order, constructed in secret and guarded by the might of our fleet. Comfortably outside of Republic space, it is nevertheless perched close enough to prepare for our decisive strike against that traitor, Malak.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00011",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    }
  },
